      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• AI CLIs (Claude, Copilot, Cursor, Aider) are powerful\n• BUT they have different interfaces, formats, and behaviors\n• Teams can't build consistent integrations\n• No standard API for routing, fallback, or testing",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• AI CLIs (Claude, Copilot, Cursor, Aider) are powerful\n• BUT they have different interfaces, formats, and behaviors\n• Teams can't build consistent integrations\n• No standard API for routing, fallback, or testing",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 88
    },
