      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "✓ Universal adapter: Turn ANY AI CLI into OpenAI-compatible API\n✓ Consistent interface for all backends\n✓ Built-in simulator for testing without API costs\n✓ Enable routing, fallback, and multi-provider strategies",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✓ Universal adapter: Turn ANY AI CLI into OpenAI-compatible API\n✓ Consistent interface for all backends\n✓ Built-in simulator for testing without API costs\n✓ Enable routing, fallback, and multi-provider strategies",
